# The Safari Game's start (docs/research/great-marsh.md): the Pastoria gate 1F's counter. Walking up to the coord
# event (z 6, VAR_PASTORIA_CITY_OBSERVATORY_GATE_1F_STATE 0) asks to play; YES pays 500 (GoToIfNotEnoughMoney,
# RemoveMoney), "received 30 Safari Balls", the walk into the gate's north door, VAR_SAFARI_GAME_STATE 1,
# start_end_safari_game 0 (FLAG_SAFARI_GAME_ACTIVE, 30 balls, 0 steps), the special location (the gate's warp 2,
# facing south) and the warp to the Great Marsh area 6 (68, 116, facing north).
party 0 platinum:SPECIES_GARCHOMP 50 platinum:MOVE_DRAGON_CLAW
set state money 3000
warp platinum:MAP_HEADER_PASTORIA_CITY_OBSERVATORY_GATE_1F 5 8 up
until idle
+0 press up
until position 5 6
+0 release up
advance text
+0 assert text platinum:PastoriaCityObservatoryGate1F_Text_AskPlaySafariGame 1
+0 press a
+1 release a
advance text
until idle
+0 assert position platinum:MAP_HEADER_GREAT_MARSH_6 68 116
+0 assert facing player up
+0 assert flag platinum:FLAG_SAFARI_GAME_ACTIVE true
+0 assert var platinum:VAR_SAFARI_GAME_STATE 1
+0 assert state money 2500
+0 assert state safari {"balls":30,"steps":0,"caught":0}
